      "title": { "en": "Saying hello" },
      "body": { "en": "Dzień dobry is the polite hello. It literally means \"good day\" and works from morning until evening. With friends and family, say cześć, which means both \"hi\" and \"bye\"." }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-u01-d01-t02",
